TESTSUITE "FNDTXFR fund transfer (IMS BMP batch)"

*> FNDTXFR reads XFERIN transfer requests and, for each valid request,
*> debits the source customer and credits the target customer by
*> inserting a pair of TRNSEG child segments under CUSTDB (DLI-GU to
*> locate each CUSTSEG root, DLI-ISRT to insert the TRNSEG child), then
*> writes one XFRRPT detail line and periodically DLI-CHKPs. Same shape
*> as ACCTPRG.cut/DEPTIMSM.cut:
*>
*> CUST-STATUS lives in CUST-PCB-LNK, originally LINKAGE SECTION storage
*> bound only through the separate ENTRY 'DLITCBL' -- mockymock's driver
*> never binds it (see docs/2026-07-08-ims-linkage-support-design.md).
*> The engine neutralizes it into real WORKING-STORAGE automatically; a
*> MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI" body can set CUST-STATUS exactly like any other
*> mocked CALL's output.
*>
*> Mocking a whole READ/CALL statement removes any clause bodies it held
*> (e.g. READ's AT END) along with it -- see
*> docs/2026-07-05-nested-mock-targets-design.md -- so mock bodies below
*> set WS-EOF / CUST-STATUS / the transfer-record fields directly rather
*> than relying on any removed clause.
*>
*> GOBACK reached through 0000-MAIN-PROCESS's plain PERFORM chain is
*> neutralized rather than killing the test binary (see
*> docs/2026-07-08-goback-stop-run-support-design.md), so the final case
*> below drives the real entry point end-to-end.

TESTCASE "1000-INITIALIZE checkpoints once and primes the first transfer record"
    MOCK OPEN XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK OPEN XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    MOCK READ XFERIN
        MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
        MOVE "ACCT00010001" TO XFR-SRC-ACCT
        MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
        MOVE "ACCT00020002" TO XFR-TGT-ACCT
        MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
    EXPECT WS-CHKP-SEQ TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-EOF-FLAG TO BE "N"
    EXPECT XFR-SRC-CIF TO BE "CUS0001234"
    EXPECT XFR-TGT-CIF TO BE "CUS0005678"
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED ONCE
    VERIFY WRITE RPT-RECORD WAS CALLED ONCE
    VERIFY READ XFERIN WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "1000-INITIALIZE flags EOF when the transfer file is empty"
    MOCK OPEN XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK OPEN XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    MOCK READ XFERIN
        SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
    EXPECT WS-EOF-FLAG TO BE "Y"

TESTCASE "2100-VALIDATE-RECORD accepts a well-formed transfer request"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    PERFORM 2100-VALIDATE-RECORD
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "N"
    EXPECT WS-INVALID-INPUT TO BE 0

TESTCASE "2100-VALIDATE-RECORD rejects a missing source CIF"
    MOVE SPACES TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    PERFORM 2100-VALIDATE-RECORD
    *> WS-DET-STATUS is PIC X(14); the program's own literal 'SRC CIF
    *> MISSING' is 15 characters, so GnuCOBOL silently truncates the
    *> trailing "G" on the MOVE -- asserting the real runtime value.
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "SRC CIF MISSIN"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-INVALID-INPUT TO BE 1

TESTCASE "2100-VALIDATE-RECORD rejects a missing target CIF"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE SPACES TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    PERFORM 2100-VALIDATE-RECORD
    *> Same PIC X(14) truncation as the source-CIF case above.
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "TGT CIF MISSIN"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-INVALID-INPUT TO BE 1

TESTCASE "2100-VALIDATE-RECORD rejects a non-numeric amount"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "NOTANUMBER" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    PERFORM 2100-VALIDATE-RECORD
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "BAD AMOUNT"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-INVALID-INPUT TO BE 1

TESTCASE "2100-VALIDATE-RECORD rejects a transfer amount of zero"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "0.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    PERFORM 2100-VALIDATE-RECORD
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "AMOUNT LE ZERO"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-INVALID-INPUT TO BE 1

TESTCASE "2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT posts a withdrawal when the source customer is found"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "ACCT00010001" TO XFR-SRC-ACCT
    MOVE "2026-08-08" TO WS-BUSINESS-DATE
    MOVE 1250.00 TO WS-AMOUNT-WORK
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        EVALUATE UT-CBLTDLI-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 2
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "N"
    EXPECT WS-TRNS-INSERTED TO BE 1
    EXPECT TRAN-CIF-NUMBER TO BE "CUS0001234"
    EXPECT TRAN-ACCT-NUMBER TO BE "ACCT00010001"
    EXPECT TRAN-TYPE TO BE "WD"
    EXPECT TRAN-CHANNEL TO BE "BATC"
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED 2 TIMES

TESTCASE "2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT flags an error when the source customer is not found"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE "GE" TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "SRC CUST NF"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-CUST-NOT-FOUND TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-TRNS-INSERTED TO BE 0
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT flags a database error on an unexpected GU status"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE "AB" TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "SRC DB ERROR"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-DB-ERRORS TO BE 1
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT flags a database error when the debit ISRT fails"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        EVALUATE UT-CBLTDLI-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 2
                MOVE "AB" TO CUST-STATUS
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2200-POST-SOURCE-DEBIT
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "DEBIT ISRT ERR"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-DB-ERRORS TO BE 1
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED 2 TIMES

TESTCASE "2300-POST-TARGET-CREDIT posts a deposit when the target customer is found"
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "ACCT00020002" TO XFR-TGT-ACCT
    MOVE "2026-08-08" TO WS-BUSINESS-DATE
    MOVE 1250.00 TO WS-AMOUNT-WORK
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        EVALUATE UT-CBLTDLI-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 2
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2300-POST-TARGET-CREDIT
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "N"
    EXPECT WS-TRNS-INSERTED TO BE 1
    EXPECT TRAN-CIF-NUMBER TO BE "CUS0005678"
    EXPECT TRAN-ACCT-NUMBER TO BE "ACCT00020002"
    EXPECT TRAN-TYPE TO BE "DP"
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED 2 TIMES

TESTCASE "2300-POST-TARGET-CREDIT flags an error when the target customer is not found"
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE "GE" TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2300-POST-TARGET-CREDIT
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "TGT CUST NF"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-CUST-NOT-FOUND TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-TRNS-INSERTED TO BE 0
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "2300-POST-TARGET-CREDIT flags a database error when the credit ISRT fails"
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        EVALUATE UT-CBLTDLI-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 2
                MOVE "AB" TO CUST-STATUS
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2300-POST-TARGET-CREDIT
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "CREDIT ISRT ER"
    EXPECT WS-RECORD-ERROR TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT WS-DB-ERRORS TO BE 1
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED 2 TIMES

TESTCASE "2400-WRITE-DETAIL writes the source and target identifiers for a posted transfer"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "ACCT00010001" TO XFR-SRC-ACCT
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "ACCT00020002" TO XFR-TGT-ACCT
    MOVE 1250.00 TO WS-AMOUNT-WORK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2400-WRITE-DETAIL
    EXPECT WS-DET-SRCCIF TO BE "CUS0001234"
    EXPECT WS-DET-SRCACCT TO BE "ACCT00010001"
    EXPECT WS-DET-TGTCIF TO BE "CUS0005678"
    EXPECT WS-DET-TGTACCT TO BE "ACCT00020002"
    VERIFY WRITE RPT-RECORD WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "2400-WRITE-DETAIL zeroes the report amount for a rejected, unpriced transfer"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE ZERO TO WS-AMOUNT-WORK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2400-WRITE-DETAIL
    VERIFY WRITE RPT-RECORD WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "2500-CHECKPOINT does not check point before the frequency threshold is reached"
    MOVE 10 TO WS-CHKP-COUNT
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CHKP-SEQ
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2500-CHECKPOINT
    EXPECT WS-CHKP-COUNT TO BE 11
    EXPECT WS-CHKP-SEQ TO BE 0
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED NEVER

TESTCASE "2500-CHECKPOINT check points and resets the counter once the frequency threshold is reached"
    MOVE 499 TO WS-CHKP-COUNT
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CHKP-SEQ
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2500-CHECKPOINT
    EXPECT WS-CHKP-COUNT TO BE 0
    EXPECT WS-CHKP-SEQ TO BE 1
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "3000-FINALIZE reports a clean return code when no errors occurred"
    MOCK CLOSE XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CLOSE XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 3000-FINALIZE
    EXPECT RETURN-CODE TO BE 0

TESTCASE "3000-FINALIZE reports a non-zero return code when database errors occurred"
    MOVE 2 TO WS-DB-ERRORS
    MOCK CLOSE XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CLOSE XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 3000-FINALIZE
    EXPECT RETURN-CODE TO BE 4

TESTCASE "3000-FINALIZE reports a non-zero return code when invalid input occurred"
    MOVE 3 TO WS-INVALID-INPUT
    MOCK CLOSE XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CLOSE XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 3000-FINALIZE
    EXPECT RETURN-CODE TO BE 4

TESTCASE "2000-PROCESS-TRANSFERS posts a complete transfer when both customers are found"
    MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "ACCT00010001" TO XFR-SRC-ACCT
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "ACCT00020002" TO XFR-TGT-ACCT
    MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        EVALUATE UT-CBLTDLI-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 2
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 3
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 4
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    MOCK READ XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-TRANSFERS
    EXPECT WS-RECS-READ TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-XFR-PROCESSED TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-XFR-ERRORS TO BE 0
    EXPECT WS-TRNS-INSERTED TO BE 2
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "TRANSFER OK"
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED 4 TIMES
    VERIFY WRITE RPT-RECORD WAS CALLED ONCE
    VERIFY READ XFERIN WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "2000-PROCESS-TRANSFERS counts a transfer error when the source customer is missing"
    MOVE "CUS0009999" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
    MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
    MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        MOVE "GE" TO CUST-STATUS
    END-MOCK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    MOCK READ XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-TRANSFERS
    EXPECT WS-RECS-READ TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-XFR-PROCESSED TO BE 0
    EXPECT WS-XFR-ERRORS TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-CUST-NOT-FOUND TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-DET-STATUS TO BE "SRC CUST NF"
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED ONCE
    VERIFY WRITE RPT-RECORD WAS CALLED ONCE

TESTCASE "0000-MAIN-PROCESS runs one fund transfer end-to-end via its real entry point"
    *> GOBACK is reached via a plain PERFORM chain (1000-INITIALIZE,
    *> 2000-PROCESS-TRANSFERS, 3000-FINALIZE), now neutralized instead of
    *> killing the suite -- see docs/2026-07-08-goback-stop-run-support-design.md.
    *> READ XFERIN fires once in 1000-INITIALIZE to prime the loop with a
    *> real transfer record, then once more inside 2000-PROCESS-TRANSFERS
    *> to signal end-of-file, so the loop body runs exactly once.
    MOCK OPEN XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK OPEN XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    MOCK WRITE RPT-RECORD
    END-MOCK
    MOCK READ XFERIN
        EVALUATE UT-READ-XFERIN-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE "CUS0001234" TO XFR-SRC-CIF
                MOVE "ACCT00010001" TO XFR-SRC-ACCT
                MOVE "CUS0005678" TO XFR-TGT-CIF
                MOVE "ACCT00020002" TO XFR-TGT-ACCT
                MOVE "1250.00" TO XFR-AMOUNT-CHAR
            WHEN OTHER
                SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CALL "CBLTDLI"
        EVALUATE UT-CBLTDLI-TALLY
            WHEN 1
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 2
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 3
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 4
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
            WHEN 5
                MOVE SPACES TO CUST-STATUS
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CLOSE XFERIN
    END-MOCK
    MOCK CLOSE XFRRPT
    END-MOCK
    PERFORM 0000-MAIN-PROCESS
    EXPECT WS-RECS-READ TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-XFR-PROCESSED TO BE 1
    EXPECT WS-XFR-ERRORS TO BE 0
    EXPECT WS-TRNS-INSERTED TO BE 2
    EXPECT WS-EOF-FLAG TO BE "Y"
    EXPECT RETURN-CODE TO BE 0
    VERIFY CALL "CBLTDLI" WAS CALLED 5 TIMES
    VERIFY READ XFERIN WAS CALLED 2 TIMES
    *> One WRITE for the header line (1000-INITIALIZE) and one for the
    *> posted transfer's detail line (2400-WRITE-DETAIL).
    VERIFY WRITE RPT-RECORD WAS CALLED 2 TIMES
